              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "M5oG5",
              "name": "rule1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "u1a6nE",
                  "name": "ruleBullet",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "01",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Te9i3",
                  "name": "ruleText",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Three layers per page: fixed frame = SideNav + sticky PageHeader (title, one-line subtitle, at most 2 actions plus an icon refresh button with sr-only label); work layer = master list/grid + detail rail that stays visible (rail sticks at 6.5rem under the header, Evidence table caps at 100vh-20rem); tool layer (import, parse, editors, rehearsal) collapses into Layout/FoldSection.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "pNtVi",
              "name": "rule2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kVULL",
                  "name": "ruleBullet",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "02",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "OEGtS",
                  "name": "ruleText",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Stat cards become Layout/StatStrip (one line) on Evidence, Jobs and Submissions so the primary object (list, grid, table) is in the first screen. Quick Run moves the job/positioning selects into Run Input and shows the model summary as one line; Agent Run does the same.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ZkIRt",
              "name": "rule3",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "REHs6",
                  "name": "ruleBullet",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "03",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "M0Shvz",
                  "name": "ruleText",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Fold defaults are state-driven: Evidence material sources open only when there are no cards; Jobs 'New job profile' (title row + JD parser) opens when there are no profiles or a parsed draft / bound lead exists, the header button only opens and focuses it; Resumes career editor opens until the record is confirmed, otherwise a one-line summary (confirmed, N jobs, N education, N skill groups).",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "UzwYI",
              "name": "rule4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vUhQx",
                  "name": "ruleBullet",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "04",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "aW3ZB",
                  "name": "ruleText",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Task tabs (Layout/SegTabs in the header): Submissions = Deliver a PDF | Records & feedback (deep link quick_run_id opens Deliver); Agent Run = Daily delivery | Agent run (deep link run_id opens Agent). The inactive tab stays mounted and hidden so state and drafts survive switching.",
