              "content": "Second- to fourth-level blocks: detail rails, editors, flow cards, folds. Implemented in pages/evidence, jobs, submissions, agent-run (+ daily-delivery), resumes (career-profile), quick-run; dictionary in i18n codes.*; alpha-capable colors in tokens.css + tailwind.config.ts.",
