                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Detail rails (Evidence, Jobs profile) open read-only: human title, status chip, grouped text, chips; an Edit button in the rail header switches to the form (Save / Cancel). Drafts, model drafts and re-review enter edit mode automatically; switching cards or a successful save leaves it. Identifiers, source material ids, raw paths and hashes live only under a Technical details fold at the bottom of the rail.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
