                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Code words never reach the user: submission step names, browser channel, source and mode codes map through i18n codes.* (steps, browser, source, mode, platform) with the raw code as tooltip or fallback. JSON receipts are folded ('Platform receipt received, raw text under Technical details'); the failure block shows no JSON for successful runs.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
