                  "content": "Daily delivery card order: today status line -> short description -> Authorization settings (folded once active, summary shows max/time) -> candidate list -> consent -> one primary button by state (run when active, save when dirty, otherwise activate); pause / revoke / close-interrupted sit behind 'More actions'; past batches are folded with a count.",
